{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are the Friendliest Skunk in the Forest!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the fur of <strong>Skunk</strong>, a small guy with a big dream: to become friends with every animal in the forest. There\u2019s just one tiny problem\u2026 Skunk\u2019s <i>scent</i> is so strong that most animals stay far, far away. Not <strong>Kevin</strong>, though! He is your ever-loyal companion who teaches you how to turn your biggest weakness into your greatest strength. With Kevin\u2019s guidance, prepare to brave the forest\u2019s many challenges. Not<i> everyone</i>\u00a0out there is friendly:\u00a0<strong>Hungry Viper Plants</strong> and <strong>patrolling Horned Owls</strong> wait patiently for a single misstep\u2026 all while grooving to the beat of the music. Wait\u2014music?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/308431705675ff47c82896a8b01935d0.avif?t=1762725061\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras_big/308431705675ff47c82896a8b01935d0.avif?t=1762725061 width=1560 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Rhythm-based Platformer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Friendliest Skunk is not<strong> just</strong>\u00a0a platformer! Everything in the world reacts to the rhythm of the music. Retractable thorns, vanishing platforms, enemy movement; and most significantly: The player's jump! That's right, Skunk has the innate ability to do a double jump, but the height of that jump is determined by how well <strong>you</strong> time your inputs! Every few beats, Skunk lets out a rhythmic little <i>fart</i>, and if you\u2019re airborne when it happens, it\u2019ll propel you higher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/5e45797e4647eb611ac63683fabdb42b.poster.avif?t=1762725061\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/5e45797e4647eb611ac63683fabdb42b.webm?t=1762725061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/5e45797e4647eb611ac63683fabdb42b.mp4?t=1762725061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you\u2019ll meet and befriend a cast of charming forest animals \u2014 each with their own personality, quirks, and story to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/2dd262f45bd5d79c0a01b6b10036a144.avif?t=1762725061\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras_big/2dd262f45bd5d79c0a01b6b10036a144.avif?t=1762725061 width=1560 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pluck the Flowers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To accomplish your grandpa's mission and make a thousand friends, Skunk has to find a way to mask his scent so he doesn't immediately... knock out potential candidates. Fortunately Kevin found some fragrant pink flowers that do just that! In his<i> Floral</i>\u00a0state, some enemies ignore Skunk completely, platforms won't break and you'll be able to talk your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/2206143d61ad18bcdf26849b4795f236.poster.avif?t=1762725061\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/2206143d61ad18bcdf26849b4795f236.webm?t=1762725061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/2206143d61ad18bcdf26849b4795f236.mp4?t=1762725061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect the Logs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Friendliest Skunk is a moderately difficult game because of its unique mechanic that can be hard to learn, but super satisfying to master. For those who dare to seek an even greater challenge we invite you to find the hidden logs in all of the levels. Logs are collectibles that typically require some more advanced knowledge of the jumps and mechanics. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/a764a9fb90cd9f096ddda6b2b960bdc8.avif?t=1762725061\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras_big/a764a9fb90cd9f096ddda6b2b960bdc8.avif?t=1762725061 width=1560 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D-platforming excellence with a musical twist to keep it fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for both controller and keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted forest with with beautiful pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each friend comes with his own soundtrack that changes the pace of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flowers change your spray type and the way you interact with the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups can change your jump height or jump frequency, making the impossible possible!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 25 logs by beating extra challenging sections.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend the animals of the forest and watch them hang around on the main menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/043d2f5929d8fa62e8da89e63726a6c6.avif?t=1762725061\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras_big/043d2f5929d8fa62e8da89e63726a6c6.webp?t=1762725061 width=1560 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/50b134bfd5854794ce52e640d2807253.poster.avif?t=1762725061\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/50b134bfd5854794ce52e640d2807253.webm?t=1762725061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/50b134bfd5854794ce52e640d2807253.mp4?t=1762725061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/b515dc120b21ab653d01b1537638c5bf.poster.avif?t=1762725061\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/b515dc120b21ab653d01b1537638c5bf.webm?t=1762725061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/b515dc120b21ab653d01b1537638c5bf.mp4?t=1762725061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/d8fb9bae755a2141502f227ea0a7684f.poster.avif?t=1762725061\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.a