anion who teaches you how to turn your biggest weakness into your greatest strength. With Kevin\u2019s guidance, prepare to brave the forest\u2019s many challenges. Not<i> everyone</i>\u00a0out there is friendly:\u00a0<strong>Hungry Viper Plants</strong> and <strong>patrolling Horned Owls</strong> wait patiently for a single misstep\u2026 all while grooving to the beat of the music. Wait\u2014music?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/308431705675ff47c82896a8b01935d0.avif?t=1762725061\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras_big/308431705675ff47c82896a8b01935d0.avif?t=1762725061 width=1560 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Rhythm-based Platformer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Friendliest Skunk is not<strong> just</strong>\u00a0a platformer! Everything in the world reacts to the rhythm of the music. Retractable thorns, vanishing platforms, enemy movement; and most significantly: The player's jump! That's right, Skunk has the innate ability to do a double jump, but the height of that jump is determined by how well <strong>you</strong> time your inputs! Every few beats, Skunk lets out a rhythmic little <i>fart</i>, and if you\u2019re airborne when it happens, it\u2019ll propel you higher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/5e45797e4647eb611ac63683fabdb42b.poster.avif?t=1762725061\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/5e45797e4647eb611ac63683fabdb42b.webm?t=1762725061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/5e45797e4647eb611ac63683f