or those who dare to seek an even greater challenge we invite you to find the hidden logs in all of the levels. Logs are collectibles that typically require some more advanced knowledge of the jumps and mechanics. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/a764a9fb90cd9f096ddda6b2b960bdc8.avif?t=1762725061\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras_big/a764a9fb90cd9f096ddda6b2b960bdc8.avif?t=1762725061 width=1560 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D-platforming excellence with a musical twist to keep it fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for both controller and keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted forest with with beautiful pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each friend comes with his own soundtrack that changes the pace of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flowers change your spray type and the way you interact with the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups can change your jump height or jump frequency, making the impossible possible!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 25 logs by beating extra challenging sections.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend the animals of the forest and watch them hang around on the main menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras/043d2f5929d8fa62e8da89e63726a6c6.avif?t=1762725061\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833330/extras_big/043d2f5929d8fa62e8da89e63726a6c6.webp?t=1762725061 width=1560 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=